Elarum langchain language langraph nu land le ela soltu irukangale enna nu yosichingala, 30 secs la na solra kelunga.

LangChain-na, unga AI agent-ku tools connect panni velai seiya help panra framework.

LangGraph-na, agent enna step-la irukku, next enna pannanum, fail aana epdi continue pannanum-nu manage pannum.

LangSmith-na, unga agent enna pannuchu, enga thappu pannuchu-nu track panna help pannum.

Langfuse-um similar observability tool, aana open source.

Langflow-na, code ezhudhama boxes connect panni AI workflows build pannalam.

LangExtract-na, long documents-la irundhu information extract panni, adhu source-la enga irundhuchu-nu identify pannum.

Idhula therinjukita mattu podhadhu, idhula projects build panni resume la potingana unga value eh vera, enna projects pannalam epdi pannalam nu complete guidance venumna, follow pannitu "lang" nu comment pannuga













thasbusveshkuyo , na solla pora concepts la neenga padikalana ,interviewer kelvi kekum podhu ungaluku ipdi dhan kekum , enna concepts la padikanum nu na solra kelunga.
Indha forty concepts-la, first indha five topics-ah strong-ah prepare pannunga!

Networking-la DNS, CDN, Load Balancer.
System Design-la Horizontal Scaling, Sharding, Rate Limiting.


Backend-la API, REST, WebSocket.

