Idhellam just definitions mattum padichaa podhadhu! Interview-la epdi use pannanum, real project-la epdi implement pannanum-nu theriyanum.

Remaining forty concepts-um, projects build panna tech stack, step-by-step implementation guide-um complete resource pack-la irukku.

